# Rootcellar Deep (CIPlay rootcellar_deep - played after Upfall Orchard, whose four apple baskets it takes; alone:
# rootcellar_deep_solo): 25 m down; the well bottom, the cellar diary, the Root Stack's foot and dry crown (10-25 deep
# pass), the pump man's log and deck box, the cellar hatch (the apples), the cellar's air, the cellar chest, the root
# cave (puffers) and its cache.
island Rootcellar Deep
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Other Half
zone well_bottom
expect step 1
read Cellar diary
expect step 2
zone stackfoot
expect step 3
zone crown
expect step 4
read Pump man Sven
expect step 5
open Pump man's deck box
wait 3
expect step 6
use cellardoor
expect story cellaropen 1
expect step 7
air cellar
expect step 8
open Cellar chest
wait 3
expect step 9
zone root_cave
kill Puffer fish
expect step 10
open Root cave cache
wait 3
expect done
